content.text:
I have enough to answer. The telemetry shows one root cause, in ts-order-other-service, and its effect reached the user-facing tier through a chain of callers. The payment, food, consign and verification-code drops look like reduced load from the closed-loop generator (loadgen→ui-dashboard fell from 171 to 5 train queries), not separate faults. Restart counts and pod sets are unchanged.

